00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:22,879
just give up resisting.

293
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:23,799
Come out!

294
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:25,879
I'm here.

295
00:15:26,559 --> 00:15:27,360
Let her go.

296
00:15:41,159 --> 00:15:41,799
Gu Jiachen,

297
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:43,320
are you stupid?

298
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:44,440
Why did you come out?

299
00:15:44,559 --> 00:15:45,639
As you said,

300
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:47,919
they are here for me.

301
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:49,559
It's none of your business.

302
00:15:58,480 --> 00:15:59,159
Gu Jiachen.

303
00:16:01,039 --> 00:16:02,720
Gu Jiachen, you're a loser.

304
00:16:03,320 --> 00:16:05,159
You can't even deal with these scum.

305
00:16:05,399 --> 00:16:06,639
You can't even protect yourself,

306
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:09,360
and you're trying to be a hero.

307
00:16:20,799 --> 00:16:21,559
Ye Xuan,

308
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:23,679
you have been asleep for three years.

309
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:25,279
Why now...

310
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:28,720
Give me back

311
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:30,480
